{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物心理因果的交代有所压缩，少了X中一些关键的犹豫缘由和转折解释，人物为什么这样想、这样做，有时不如X清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的普通观众，Y的关键词加亮、话与感受交替，以及感受随音乐到时出现，让我更容易迅速抓住每段重点，也更容易感受到音乐中细微的情绪变化和层次。X的优势是人物心理的因果交代更完整，前后转变的来龙去脉更清楚，尤其结尾对人物最终选择的解释更有分量。总体我选Y，因为实际观看时，Y更容易让我同时跟住叙事和音乐，但它确实牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3657b4e0-a6a6-48f4-b750-8676a572cec8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T124158592538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T12:42:58.101609+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ec5d48e4a1896c5baebb3663afc9799382aa2b297bf8af17cb613a63ffca531", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att